@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Introduction to Microsoft Azure";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-center lead">Microsoft Azure is a comprehensive cloud computing platform that provides a wide range of services, including virtual computing, analytics, storage, and networking. It enables businesses to build, deploy, and manage applications efficiently.</p>
    <hr />

    <div class="mt-4">
        <p>
            Azure offers solutions for various industries, enabling organizations to leverage cloud-based infrastructure, artificial intelligence (AI), machine learning (ML), and data analytics. It provides a secure, scalable, and cost-effective approach to cloud computing.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h2>Key Features of Microsoft Azure</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Azure operates data centers across multiple regions worldwide, ensuring low latency and redundancy.</li>
                <li><strong>Hybrid Cloud Capabilities:</strong> Supports hybrid environments, allowing seamless integration with on-premises infrastructure.</li>
                <li><strong>AI & Machine Learning:</strong> Provides powerful AI and ML tools for data-driven decision-making.</li>
                <li><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Azure offers built-in security controls, identity management, and regulatory compliance.</li>
                <li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Easily scale applications and infrastructure to meet dynamic business needs.</li>
                <li><strong>Cost Efficiency:</strong> Pay-as-you-go pricing helps organizations optimize expenses based on usage.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
            <img src="https://azure.microsoft.com/svghandler/azure-overview?width=600&height=315" alt="Microsoft Azure Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Microsoft Azure enables scalable, secure, and cost-effective cloud solutions.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2>Popular Azure Services</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Azure provides a vast portfolio of services that cater to various business needs. Some of the most commonly used services include:</p>
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <h4>Azure Virtual Machines</h4>
                <p>Scalable virtual servers for hosting applications and workloads.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <h4>Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)</h4>
                <p>Managed Kubernetes for deploying and scaling containerized applications.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <h4>Azure SQL Database</h4>
                <p>Fully managed relational database with built-in intelligence.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2>Advantages of Using Microsoft Azure</h2>
        <table class="table table-bordered text-center mt-3">
            <thead class="table-dark">
                <tr>
                    <th>Advantage</th>
                    <th>Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Flexibility</strong></td>
                    <td>Supports various programming languages, frameworks, and deployment options.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Disaster Recovery</strong></td>
                    <td>Ensures business continuity with geo-redundant backups and failover solutions.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Advanced Security</strong></td>
                    <td>Provides multi-layered security, identity access management, and threat detection.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Integration with Microsoft Products</strong></td>
                    <td>Seamless integration with Office 365, Dynamics 365, and other Microsoft services.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2>Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Microsoft Azure is a leading cloud platform that enables businesses to modernize their IT infrastructure, improve operational efficiency, and drive innovation. With its extensive suite of services, security features, and scalability, Azure is a preferred choice for enterprises worldwide.
        </p>
        <p>
            As cloud computing continues to evolve, Azure remains at the forefront, offering cutting-edge solutions for businesses of all sizes.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-4">
        <a href="@Url.Action("OverviewOfCloudComputing", "AzureDevOps")" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">&larr; Previous: Overview of Cloud Computing</a>
        <a href="@Url.Action("WhatIsAzureDevOps", "AzureDevOps")" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Next: What is Azure DevOps? &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</div>
